  "title": "Orange Chocolate Chip Muffins",
  "description": "Chocolate chips and fresh orange come together in perfect harmony to make these quick and easy muffins that get their melt-in-your-mouth texture from sour cream.",
  "authors": [
    "shazzieau"
  ],
